  "releaseNotes": "- Accessibility: Global MD3 Focus Ring system for standardized, high-visibility keyboard navigation across all interactive components.\n- Slider Enhancements: Added 'Centered' variant (bipolar range support) and optional 'Value Label' (Balloon) tooltips.\n- UI Polish: Resolved 'overflow: hidden' clipping issues for focus rings and floating labels in picker components.\n- Navigation Enhancement: High-fidelity sliding selection indicator with robust UID-based targeting.\n- List Standardization: Implemented 'Inset Rounded' selection and hover states with consistent 12px horizontal gaps.",
